{title: Humko Man Ki Shakti Dena}
{artist: Guddi Vani Jairam Vasant Desai}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D]Hum ko [G]man kee [D]shakti dienaa,
[D]Man [G]vijay kare
[D]Dusaron kee [G]jay se pahale,
[D]Khud [G]ko [A]jay [D]kare
[D]Bhedabhaaw [G]apane [D]Dil se
[G]Saaf [A]kar [D]sake
[D]Doston [G]se bhool [D]ho To
[G]Maaf [A]kar [D]sake
[D]Zoothh [G]se [D]bache rahe,
[D]Sach kaa [G]dam bhare
[D]Dusaron kee [G]jay se pahale,
[D]Khud [G]ko [A]jay [D]kare
[D]Mushkile [G]pade to [D]hum Pe
[G]Itanaa [A]karam [D]kar
[D]Saath [G]de to [D]dharam kaa,
[G]Chale [A]to [D]dharam kar
[D]Khud [G]pe [D]hausalaa rahe,
[D]Badee se [G]naa dare
[D]Dusaron kee [G]jay se pahale,
[D]Khud [G]ko [A]jay [D]kare
